{"parse": {"title": "12TH-09", "pageid": 127794, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/12TH-08\" title=\"12TH-08\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">12TH-09</span><a href=\"/wiki/12TH-10\" title=\"12TH-10\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">12TH</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">09</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.99.BD.E5.A4.9C\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"白夜\">白夜</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 白夜</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">White Night</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>维<span class=\"color-value\"></span>系<span class=\"color-value\"></span>众<span class=\"color-value\"></span>志<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>不<span class=\"color-value\"></span>只<span class=\"color-value\"></span>忠<span class=\"color-value\"></span>诚<span class=\"color-value\"></span>—<span class=\"color-value\"></span>—<span class=\"color-value\"></span>它<span class=\"color-value\"></span>还<span class=\"color-value\"></span>可<span class=\"color-value\"></span>以<span class=\"color-value\"></span>是<span class=\"color-value\"></span>仇<span class=\"color-value\"></span>恨<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 11209</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_3_bg_01.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_3_bg_01\"><img alt=\"3_3_bg_01\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/Cg-3_3_bg_01.png/600px-Cg-3_3_bg_01.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/Cg-3_3_bg_01.png/900px-Cg-3_3_bg_01.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/Cg-3_3_bg_01.png/1200px-Cg-3_3_bg_01.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>芝诺骑兵军再度启程，在夜色的掩护下向别列格勒而去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>狮鹫军驻守在城外的主要道路旁，两支军队在深邃的黑夜中保持着相互的警惕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>两双沉重的马靴缓慢地在草地上踏着步。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309221.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-309221.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309221.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309221.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-309221.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309221.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-309221.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309221.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>我猜说服你手下的人一定花了你不少时间。尤其是斯捷尔诺娃，她不是一个好对付的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529614.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-529614.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529614.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529614.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-529614.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529614.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-529614.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529614.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>我给他们的承诺是，顿河会迎来和平。但莎宾娜不这么认为，她说，“叛徒永远是叛徒，不可信任。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309213.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-309213.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309213.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309213.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-309213.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309213.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-309213.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309213.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>她说得也没错。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伊戈尔抬起手，在满是疤痕的小臂上，一圈刻工规整的符号在夜色中散发着微光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>芝诺过去为每一个神秘学家将领单独定制的抑制神秘术咒文，为了防止神秘术的不合规使用。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309221.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-309221.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309221.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309221.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-309221.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309221.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-309221.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309221.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>……没想到还是用上了它。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529614.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-529614.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529614.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529614.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-529614.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529614.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-529614.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529614.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>我知道你的神秘术能让一支军队从战场上消失，我不能没有防范。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309218.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-309218.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309218.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309218.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-309218.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309218.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-309218.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309218.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>谨慎是好习惯。让我意外的是，你还记得针对我的抑制咒文写法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-529601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-529601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-529601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>因为我相信会有用上它的这一天，当然，这次和我想象中的情况很不一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>军长不想继续这个话题，他将目光从伊戈尔手臂上的符文移走。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>“鹰派”的老东西会要了我的命，或许索姆也会受牵连。你最好真的能像你保证的那样把问题解决。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>我知道基金会不希望骑兵军与我发生冲突，而且司辰一定给了为你担保的承诺。她的话不会被忽视的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>如果不是司辰在别列格勒有特殊的任务，他们会命令你立刻撤离顿河，连两周的缓冲期也没有。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>你从哪里截取的情报？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>我不需要截取情报，只要在联合委员会里坐着的还是那一批人，我就能猜出他们的想法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>你是哥萨克，所以他们把你送到顿河，补充兵员。但是他们不愿意让你驻留家乡，也因为你是哥萨克。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>不要这样和我说话，伊戈尔。我们已经不是同一条船上的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>不管是被降职，还是被关进监牢，我都会认命。我只是希望保证家乡的安全。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伊戈尔的目光顺着河流，看向上游。别列格勒低沉的屋顶，在星夜的照耀下竟有如萤光闪烁。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>这里是我们长大的地方，我和你都是在别列格勒与家人告别，然后跟着同级的新人加入芝诺。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>如果是在白天，比较晴朗的时候，站在这里差不多就能看见别列格勒教堂的尖顶。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>现在城市小了很多，如果是在99年，我们站着的地方，就可以看见别列格勒的城郊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>河流的拐点也不一样，很多东西都有所不同。这里终究是要被洪流冲走的，别寄予太多怀念。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>但这里的人还是一样的，草原的模样也没有改变，风里的青草和泥土味与世纪末的没有什么不同。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>我还是很难相信你说的话。格鲁托夫甚至不是顿河唯一的问题，解决他也不能挽救顿河。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>“金色饥荒”最终会将这个时代的顿河变成一片荒芜之地，人们要么饿死，要么远走他乡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>这一个冬天，顿河人都只能靠上一年的存粮过日子，而一些家境稍差的人，根本没有剩余的粮食。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>基金会认为“金色饥荒”是由什么导致的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>基金会根本匀不出人手来调查这里的异常，顿河不是战争的焦点，不值得他们关心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>可笑的是，现在反而只能寄希望于一场“暴雨”，运气好的话，下一个时代一切又会恢复正常。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伊戈尔没有接过伊万这显得有些残忍的玩笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>季节倒错是一场仪式。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>一场仪式？覆盖整个顿河下游地区的气候，这怎么可能？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-507001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-507001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-507001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">传令兵：</div><div>军长——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>问题尚未得到解答，传令兵那急躁的呼喊声就插入了二位将领的谈话——这是作为传令兵的特权之一。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他气喘吁吁地靠近，站稳后弯下了腰，双手撑着大腿大口喘着气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>有什么要事？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>传令兵的呼吸频率很不正常，似乎不是出于劳累，而是出于面临极端险境的恐慌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他带着有些好奇的神色，看向一旁的芝诺叛军首领。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-507001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-507001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-507001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">传令兵：</div><div>伊戈尔……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他用谁也没有注意到的声音喃喃自语，逐渐找回了呼吸的节奏。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>站直身子的瞬间，他掏出一把手枪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-507001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-507001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-507001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">传令兵：</div><div>为了……为了阿廖沙！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_3_at_12.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_3_at_12\"><img alt=\"3_3_at_12\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/Cg-3_3_at_12.png/600px-Cg-3_3_at_12.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/Cg-3_3_at_12.png/900px-Cg-3_3_at_12.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/Cg-3_3_at_12.png/1200px-Cg-3_3_at_12.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309217.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/HeadIconSmall-309217.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309217.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309217.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/HeadIconSmall-309217.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309217.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/HeadIconSmall-309217.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309217.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>呵——</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_3_bg_01.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_3_bg_01\"><img alt=\"3_3_bg_01\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/Cg-3_3_bg_01.png/600px-Cg-3_3_bg_01.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/Cg-3_3_bg_01.png/900px-Cg-3_3_bg_01.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/Cg-3_3_bg_01.png/1200px-Cg-3_3_bg_01.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伊戈尔向后踉跄着退了两步，屈膝半跪在了地上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>行刺者颤抖的手让弹道偏离了预定方向，子弹没能忠诚地履行造成死亡的职责。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_3_at_12.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_3_at_12\"><img alt=\"3_3_at_12\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/Cg-3_3_at_12.png/600px-Cg-3_3_at_12.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/Cg-3_3_at_12.png/900px-Cg-3_3_at_12.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/Cg-3_3_at_12.png/1200px-Cg-3_3_at_12.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>短暂的震惊后，军长跨步上前擒住了传令兵的手腕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>你在干什么，士兵？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>传令兵的脸被军长按在地上，他每咆哮出一个词，都能尝到故乡泥土的腥。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">传令兵：</div><div>我的兄弟——阿廖沙——死了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">传令兵：</div><div>他的血染红了圣保罗！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">传令兵：</div><div>凭什么？因为他不是神秘学家？因为他对你投靠重塑之手没有价值？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>没有人回答他的话，被枪击声惊扰的夜晚归于寂静。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>按照芝诺的军事法，任何蓄意阻碍军队达成战略目标的士兵，将会以叛徒的身份被枪决。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_3_bg_01.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_3_bg_01\"><img alt=\"3_3_bg_01\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/Cg-3_3_bg_01.png/600px-Cg-3_3_bg_01.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/Cg-3_3_bg_01.png/900px-Cg-3_3_bg_01.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/Cg-3_3_bg_01.png/1200px-Cg-3_3_bg_01.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伊戈尔缓缓站了起来，他握住了坠在胸前的军籍牌，上面留下了被子弹擦过的凹痕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>遇刺的叛军领袖的神情沉如顿河静谧的夜晚，他上前一步，踢开了落在地上的作案工具。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>让他走吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>我的军队不用你来指挥。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不远处传来了战马嘶鸣，一支支火把如街灯亮起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-507001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-507001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-507001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">传令兵：</div><div>放开我！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在钳制者分神的瞬间，传令兵挣脱了桎梏向坡下的行军队列中滚去。他很快溜进了行军队伍，火把也逐一灭了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529612.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-529612.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529612.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529612.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-529612.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529612.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-529612.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529612.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>该死的——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>军长对着夜幕开了几枪，但是什么都没有打中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529613.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/HeadIconSmall-529613.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529613.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529613.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/HeadIconSmall-529613.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529613.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/HeadIconSmall-529613.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529613.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518013.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-518013.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518013.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518013.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-518013.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518013.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-518013.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518013.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">托勒密：</div><div>父亲——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>忠诚的孩子怨恨自己迟来一步。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/HeadIconSmall-518001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/HeadIconSmall-518001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/HeadIconSmall-518001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">托勒密：</div><div>伊万诺维奇，你别想着包庇那个畜——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伊戈尔挥手制止了养子未出口的话，转向了军长。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>这件事我可以忘记，你也可以。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>你的士兵们在保护他。骑兵军里有不少芝诺的老兵，追究此事容易动摇军心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>我告诉过你，在军队中没有什么比团结更重要。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>你的骑兵军会是最团结的部队，他们理应像亲人一样关系紧密，相互托付后背。因为他们本来就是亲人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在胸口几次深沉的起伏之后，伊万将手枪插回武装带。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>怨恨你的幸存者，射向你的子弹，背叛你的格鲁托夫，还有你即将陷入战火的“家”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>看看你的所作所为吧，伊戈尔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>我铭记于心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>……让我们回到没有说完的话，关于那场导致“金色饥荒”的仪式。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>这是重塑之手的杰作，由多重节点术式维系。他们最终希望将仪式扩展到整个顿河与第聂伯河地区。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>数百万平方公里的黑土地中将没有粮食生长，整个欧洲都会陷入饥饿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>什么样的施术者能用神秘术来影响百万平方公里的气候？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>不要忘了，伊万，我们的敌人是复生的“神明”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在孩子的搀扶下，叛军领袖走下山坡。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_3_bg_12.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_3_bg_12\"><img alt=\"3_3_bg_12\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/Cg-3_3_bg_12.png/600px-Cg-3_3_bg_12.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/Cg-3_3_bg_12.png/900px-Cg-3_3_bg_12.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/Cg-3_3_bg_12.png/1200px-Cg-3_3_bg_12.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"530114.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-530114.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-530114.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"530114.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-530114.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-530114.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-530114.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-530114.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">仪式术士：</div><div>现在，保持呼吸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一只香炉被术士高举过头顶，它的孔隙中涌出色彩迷离的烟雾。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"632110.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-632110.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-632110.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"632110.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-632110.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-632110.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-632110.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-632110.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">俘虏：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>烟雾如同一只气态的多足爬行生物一般，在被捆缚的俘虏周身缓缓爬行。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"632111.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-632111.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-632111.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"632111.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-632111.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-632111.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-632111.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-632111.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">俘虏：</div><div>呵、呵呃——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"632111.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-632111.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-632111.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"632111.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-632111.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-632111.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-632111.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-632111.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">俘虏：</div><div>啊啊——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">格鲁托夫：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>面对这场糟糕的表演，格鲁托夫不屑地挑起眉梢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">格鲁托夫：</div><div>死了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>术士伸手于香炉上方一抚，纷乱的烟雾立时收束。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">仪式术士：</div><div>我还是低估了人类精神的孱弱程度，下次应该能把握到更好的分寸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">格鲁托夫：</div><div>为什么不把他们带到“冰山”上去研究？还是说你想的就是独自占有研究的成果？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">仪式术士：</div><div>所有的功业都属于祂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>术士含糊其词地回应着。格鲁托夫挥挥手，让一名士兵将尸体拖走。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">格鲁托夫：</div><div>我没有时间照顾你的实验了，两个小时之后，我的军队就要前往别列格勒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">仪式术士：</div><div>别列格勒？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她显然没有预料到这个决定。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">仪式术士：</div><div>我们终会夺下那座城市，将它的财富与生命洗劫一空，可是……现在？“冰山”的命令可不是攻取城市。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">仪式术士：</div><div>我们会用饥饿来消灭敌人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">格鲁托夫：</div><div>给了我军队，我就有权力调动他们。伊戈尔和伊万见过面了，他们正在向别列格勒进军，我必须拦住他们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一阵发动机的轰鸣声传来——负责运载重型武器的车队已经启动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">格鲁托夫：</div><div>我的军队已经准备好发动一次决战，这是我消灭伊戈尔的最好机会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">格鲁托夫：</div><div>如果你们不给我那一份奇迹，我就会自己去夺过来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">仪式术士：</div><div>一个节点失守，其他节点的术式范围也会受到影响。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">仪式术士：</div><div>如果冬天降临，我们接下来在东线的攻势会受到严重影响，而整个针对欧洲的计划都会受到拖延。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">仪式术士：</div><div>你拥有的特权不是无限的，将军。迟早有一天，你和你的人也要接受祂的试炼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">格鲁托夫：</div><div>你们没有要求伊戈尔和他的人戴上面具，为什么现在又提出这种要求。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一把手枪顶上术士的前额，但后者不为所动，反倒咧嘴而笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-529714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-529714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-529714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格鲁托夫：</div><div>伊戈尔只是一个孱弱而优柔寡断的中间派，不敢直面自己的渴望。我比他要强得多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">仪式术士：</div><div>你认为我会害怕死亡吗？祂最终会令所有神秘学家的灵魂复苏，一切功过是非都将得以澄清。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">仪式术士：</div><div>你大可送我去见祂，我将念着祂的美名而死。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>格鲁托夫放下枪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">格鲁托夫：</div><div>恶心的怪物。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_3_bg_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_3_bg_20\"><img alt=\"3_3_bg_20\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/Cg-3_3_bg_20.png/600px-Cg-3_3_bg_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/Cg-3_3_bg_20.png/900px-Cg-3_3_bg_20.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0e/Cg-3_3_bg_20.png/1200px-Cg-3_3_bg_20.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他看着一名格鲁托夫的士兵将一具新的人类尸体拖至营地外侧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>对于已死之人来说，此刻的感受更加接近于“枯萎”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/HeadIconSmall-527901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/HeadIconSmall-527901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/HeadIconSmall-527901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>还会有多少人因此而死？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-527201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-527201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-527201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">重塑士兵：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_3_bg_12.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_3_bg_12\"><img alt=\"3_3_bg_12\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/Cg-3_3_bg_12.png/600px-Cg-3_3_bg_12.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/Cg-3_3_bg_12.png/900px-Cg-3_3_bg_12.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/Cg-3_3_bg_12.png/1200px-Cg-3_3_bg_12.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>士兵乜斜一眼，没有回话，低着头离开了。卡戎感受到一种更强的压迫感正在靠近。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529715.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-529715.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529715.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529715.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-529715.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529715.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-529715.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529715.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格鲁托夫：</div><div>这是你自己选的，卡戎，他们的死都会算在你头上。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_3_at_13.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_3_at_13\"><img alt=\"3_3_at_13\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Cg-3_3_at_13.png/600px-Cg-3_3_at_13.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Cg-3_3_at_13.png/900px-Cg-3_3_at_13.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Cg-3_3_at_13.png/1200px-Cg-3_3_at_13.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>亡者回过头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/HeadIconSmall-527901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/HeadIconSmall-527901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/HeadIconSmall-527901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>如果我的顺从能换来你对生命的敬重，我不会拒绝。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/HeadIconSmall-527901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/HeadIconSmall-527901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/HeadIconSmall-527901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>可是……我不理解我的选择能带来多少改变，这些人仍然会因为其他的理由死在你的手上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">格鲁托夫：</div><div>我没有重塑之手那么疯狂，我只是喜欢效率。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/HeadIconSmall-527901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/HeadIconSmall-527901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/HeadIconSmall-527901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>既然你厌恶重塑之手的行径，也并不属于戴上面具的那些人，那为什么要为他们服务？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">格鲁托夫：</div><div>是他们在为我服务，因为这群神秘学家疯子需要我，不然他们根本找不到懂得军事战略的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">格鲁托夫：</div><div>他们所谓的将领，只会愚蠢地让所有能用的士兵往一个方向进攻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>格鲁托夫顿了顿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">格鲁托夫：</div><div>你觉得我和他们有什么相似点？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/HeadIconSmall-527901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/HeadIconSmall-527901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/HeadIconSmall-527901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>战争，破坏和无止尽的死亡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">格鲁托夫：</div><div>目的是不同的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/HeadIconSmall-527901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/HeadIconSmall-527901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/HeadIconSmall-527901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>对我来说没有什么不同。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">格鲁托夫：</div><div>可惜，如果你能留在我身边，会是一个好的聊天对象。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>亡者未能及时领悟到格鲁托夫话中的暗示。他看见一名士兵牵着一匹黑马向自己走来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/HeadIconSmall-527901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/HeadIconSmall-527901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/HeadIconSmall-527901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>安德烈森？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-528101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-528101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-528101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安德烈森：</div><div>咴……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_1_bg_chezhan1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_1_bg_chezhan1\"><img alt=\"3_1_bg_chezhan1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/Cg-3_1_bg_chezhan1.png/600px-Cg-3_1_bg_chezhan1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/Cg-3_1_bg_chezhan1.png/900px-Cg-3_1_bg_chezhan1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/Cg-3_1_bg_chezhan1.png/1200px-Cg-3_1_bg_chezhan1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/HeadIconSmall-527901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/HeadIconSmall-527901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/HeadIconSmall-527901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>……？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_3_at_41.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_3_at_41\"><img alt=\"3_3_at_41\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/Cg-3_3_at_41.png/600px-Cg-3_3_at_41.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/Cg-3_3_at_41.png/900px-Cg-3_3_at_41.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/Cg-3_3_at_41.png/1200px-Cg-3_3_at_41.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在他没察觉到的时候，已经有两名士兵来到身后，此刻正用粗硬的草绳捆缚他的双手。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_3_at_13.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_3_at_13\"><img alt=\"3_3_at_13\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Cg-3_3_at_13.png/600px-Cg-3_3_at_13.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Cg-3_3_at_13.png/900px-Cg-3_3_at_13.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Cg-3_3_at_13.png/1200px-Cg-3_3_at_13.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>这是在做什么？你们已经用术阵限制了我的行动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">格鲁托夫：</div><div>我对你有别的安排。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_3_at_34.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_3_at_34\"><img alt=\"3_3_at_34\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/Cg-3_3_at_34.png/600px-Cg-3_3_at_34.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/Cg-3_3_at_34.png/900px-Cg-3_3_at_34.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/Cg-3_3_at_34.png/1200px-Cg-3_3_at_34.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "12TH-09"}}